              "value": "Drill Deeper"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(manipulate)\n\nRequirements: Nils Kelveken hit a creature with a hand drill Strike with his previous action\n\nNils grabs the drill and twists, drilling deeper into the victim. He automatically deals 1d8 piercing damage, and the creature being drilled into must succeed at a DC 22 Fortitude save to avoid taking an additional 1d6 persistent bleed damage (2d6 on a critical failure)."
            },
